<title>POLAND: ELEKTROMONTAZ IN DM 2.2 MLN GERMAN DEALS.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROMONTAZ IN DM 2.2 MLN GERMAN DEALS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction company Elektromontaz Export SA signed three contracts worth a total of 2.2 million marks for construction works in Germany, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the works would be carried out from September 1996 to June 1997.</p>
<p>It did not give any further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
